sequenceDiagram
    participant Browser as Browser / Client
    participant Route as OpenShift Route<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant KRBP as kube-rbac-proxy<br/>OAuth Proxy
    participant Fastify as Fastify Backend<br/>8443/TCP HTTPS
    participant BFF as BFF Sidecar<br/>(e.g. gen-ai:8143/TLS)
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Platform as Platform Services<br/>(KServe, ModelRegistry, etc.)

    Note over Browser,Platform: User Request Flow (SPA Assets)
    Browser->>Route: GET / (HTTPS/443)
    Route->>KRBP: Forward request
    KRBP->>KRBP: Inject x-forwarded-access-token,<br/>x-auth-request-user,<br/>x-auth-request-groups
    KRBP->>Fastify: Forward with auth headers
    Fastify-->>KRBP: React SPA static assets
    KRBP-->>Route: Response
    Route-->>Browser: HTML/JS/CSS

    Note over Browser,Platform: API Proxy Flow (K8s Resources)
    Browser->>Route: GET /api/k8s/... (HTTPS/443)
    Route->>KRBP: Forward request
    KRBP->>Fastify: x-forwarded-access-token
    Fastify->>K8sAPI: Proxy with user token<br/>(impersonation)<br/>HTTPS/6443
    K8sAPI-->>Fastify: K8s resource response
    Fastify-->>Browser: JSON response

    Note over Browser,Platform: BFF Sidecar Flow (Domain APIs)
    Browser->>Route: GET /gen-ai/api/v1/... (HTTPS/443)
    Route->>KRBP: Forward request
    KRBP->>Fastify: x-forwarded-access-token
    Fastify->>BFF: /_mf/gen-ai/* or /gen-ai/api/*<br/>TLS/8143
    BFF->>BFF: InjectRequestIdentity middleware<br/>Extract bearer token
    BFF->>K8sAPI: SubjectAccessReview<br/>(per-request RBAC check)
    K8sAPI-->>BFF: Allowed/Denied
    BFF->>Platform: Proxy to platform service<br/>HTTPS/TLS
    Platform-->>BFF: Service response
    BFF-->>Fastify: Domain API response
    Fastify-->>Browser: JSON response

    Note over Browser,Platform: WebSocket Flow (K8s Watch)
    Browser->>Route: WS /wss/k8s/* (WSS/443)
    Route->>KRBP: Upgrade to WebSocket
    KRBP->>Fastify: WSS with user token
    Fastify->>K8sAPI: K8s Watch stream<br/>WSS/6443
    K8sAPI-->>Fastify: Watch events (streaming)
    Fastify-->>Browser: WebSocket events

    Note over Browser,Platform: Operator Reconciliation Flow
    participant Operator as Dashboard Operator<br/>controller-runtime
    K8sAPI->>Operator: Dashboard CR created/updated<br/>(Watch event)
    Operator->>K8sAPI: Create Deployments, Services,<br/>Routes, RBAC, NetworkPolicies,<br/>PDBs, ConfigMaps
    K8sAPI-->>Operator: Resources reconciled
